- Calculation trap: Incorrectly manipulating the inner product expressions when checking orthogonality
- Completeness trap: Not fully verifying that the proposed solution y actually works for all pairs of points in S
- Existence trap: Not properly establishing the existence of such a point y (the problem doesn't ask for an explicit construction, just to show existence)

